{#- Technology (content file 5.2; seven sections since 25 October 2026, the reviewer's site map, 3.1):
    for clinicians and laboratory heads, the page that must survive expert scrutiny. The opening; the
    method in the poster's six pictures (the company's own, cut from Lightening Lives Poster v9), the
