      <ul class="approvals mt-12" id="patents">
        <li>
          <span class="approval-mark">{% icon "badge-check" %}</span>
          <h3>ICMR approved</h3>
          <p>LitLife™-SCA, our sickle cell test, is approved by the Indian Council of Medical Research.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="approval-mark">{% icon "award" %}</span>
          <h3>Patents granted in India and Japan</h3>
          <p>For the technology behind our dried blood spot tests.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="approval-mark">{% icon "globe" %}</span>
          <h3>A globally published patent</h3>
          <p>The method is published internationally.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="approval-mark">{% icon "landmark" %}</span>
          <h3>Built on CSIR-CCMB know-how</h3>
          <p>An MOU with the CSIR-Centre for Cellular and Molecular Biology, Hyderabad, covers developing and commercialising the sickle cell assay.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

